#: Privacy/PersonalData.php:241
msgid "When you withdraw from a contract, we store your name, email address, order number, the products you return, the optional reason, the text of your statement with the date and time it was made, a hash of your IP address, the tracking number you add and, when the payment method cannot refund automatically (cash on delivery, bank transfer), the bank account number for the refund (encrypted). We use this data to handle the withdrawal and the refund, and keep it as long as the related order. On an erasure request we anonymize closed requests and keep only the request number, dates, amounts and a hash of the statement as proof; requests still being handled are anonymized after they are closed. The data stays on our server and is not sent to third parties."
msgstr ""

